{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"h":0.017434303789697569,"c":1,"t":"Test 1","y":0.070860706644813254,"w":0.059713001251220588,"x":0.81696755585415881},{"x":0.069501580051448672,"y":0.11874853748738445,"t":"As far as disabled drivers are concerned, at present they have parking outside the","w":0.62604863484700524,"c":1,"h":0.0196141183414692},{"w":0.66729324340820317,"t":"supermarket, but lorries also use those spaces, so we've got two new disabled parking","x":0.069548866753904259,"y":0.13517441860819623,"c":1,"h":0.019043224823528604},{"y":0.14969416122794499,"t":"spaces on the side road up towards the bank. It's not ideal, but probably better than the","h":0.020394470794540154,"x":0.069464804888648646,"w":0.66554229736328119,"c":1},{"h":0.021243807122696579,"c":1,"t":"present arrangement.","y":0.16514194418037986,"w":0.16462579091389973,"x":0.068813119902610201},{"c":1,"x":0.069486495999286718,"y":0.18922303250355244,"t":"We also plan to widen the pavement on School Road. We think we can manage to get an","w":0.68242497762044274,"h":0.02010377821274445},{"w":0.70121856689453121,"t":"extra half-metre on the bend just before you get to the school, on the same side of the road.","h":0.020020928907916402,"y":0.20528950675369728,"x":0.069488859463069347,"c":1},{"t":"Finally, we've introduced new restrictions on loading and unloading for the supermarket, so","h":0.015988372635703185,"y":0.2311046508853013,"c":1,"x":0.069548863386454982,"w":0.69548873901367192},{"c":1,"w":0.71062489827473951,"h":0.018757637132004734,"t":"lorries will only be allowed to stop there before 8 am. That's the supermarket on School Road","x":0.069492100405313603,"y":0.24580557600779329},{"t":"- we kept to the existing arrangements with the High Street supermarket.","h":0.017558698414681606,"c":1,"y":0.26170595667415975,"w":0.55651229858398432,"x":0.069478086917886234},{"h":0.016105362621339214,"c":1,"w":0.33834587097167967,"x":0.069548868951677986,"y":0.28622021903523032,"t":"OK. So that's about it. Now, would anyone .."},{"t":"FB.com\/LouisQuangVo","y":0.28924418576478961,"w":0.15977443695068361,"h":0.015988372635703185,"c":1,"x":0.4379699242829338},{"x":0.79035627843388478,"w":0.039754053751627549,"h":0.01606532242400982,"t":"Q18","c":1,"y":0.13596956223526024},{"h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1,"t":"Q19","y":0.19331395350702163,"w":0.037593984603881858,"x":0.79135338354945228},{"w":0.03571428616841632,"c":1,"t":"Q20","x":0.79323308239159063,"y":0.23255813968939698,"h":0.014534883321060788},{"y":0.34516758784472246,"w":0.14346983591715495,"c":1,"x":0.071101980461088579,"h":0.01857351289590714,"t":"SECTION 3"},{"c":1,"y":0.37936046499999299,"t":"EMMA:","x":0.069548871493872441,"h":0.011627907148116789,"w":0.041353384653727218},{"y":0.37335069215296979,"h":0.020913498062359759,"x":0.14460563963170917,"c":1,"w":0.58672678629557296,"t":"We've got to choose a topic for our experiment, haven't we, Jack? Were you"},{"t":"thinking of something to do with seeds?","h":0.016120337703039112,"y":0.39085640674931954,"c":1,"x":0.14285714305234165,"w":0.31015037536621093},{"y":0.41133720918433947,"w":0.037593984603881844,"c":1,"t":"JACK:","h":0.011627907148116901,"x":0.069548872265728243},{"y":0.40588048151582856,"w":0.61485717773437498,"h":0.018762274089353936,"t":"That's right. I thought we could look at seed germination - how a seed begins to","x":0.14463693435530559,"c":1},{"t":"grow.","x":0.1447368418200653,"y":0.42587209304923379,"w":0.043233083089192714,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"t":"EMMA:","w":0.041378288269042968,"x":0.071416118924972433,"y":0.44327861801960933,"h":0.0087916011282189732,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.43882807470345608,"h":0.016113786028034927,"w":0.55827067057291657,"t":"OK. Any particular reason? I know you're hoping to work in plant science","x":0.14473684499246103},{"x":0.14473684131401612,"y":0.45639534885990884,"h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1,"t":"eventually ...","w":0.099624061584472651},{"y":0.47383720918030203,"c":1,"w":0.03759398460388183,"h":0.011627907148116901,"t":"JACK:","x":0.069548872277476387},{"h":0.015988372635703074,"y":0.47093023228414377,"t":"Yeah, but practically everything we do is going to feed into that. No, there's an","w":0.59962407430013021,"x":0.14473683493078066,"c":1},{"x":0.79323308238571655,"w":0.03571428616841632,"y":0.47238372094888215,"c":1,"h":0.013081395234588733,"t":"Q21"},{"c":1,"t":"optional module on seed structure and function in the third year that I might do.","w":0.61101282755533859,"x":0.1446895851482779,"h":0.017100092831996649,"y":0.48583422210877591},{"w":0.62042948404947917,"t":"so I thought it might be useful for that. If I choose that option, I don't have to do a","x":0.14467486417530229,"y":0.50149543188873102,"h":0.017914262342974996,"c":1},{"h":0.017531001329882612,"t":"dissertation module.","c":1,"x":0.14440447666329628,"w":0.16057281494140627,"y":0.51753658797769375},{"y":0.53779069772873955,"x":0.071428570732570695,"h":0.010174418447559619,"t":"EMMA:","c":1,"w":0.041353384653727204},{"y":0.55232558137215049,"h":0.010174418447559619,"x":0.073308271332004349,"t":"JACK:","c":1,"w":0.033834584554036456},{"w":0.08915450414021811,"h":0.015338666194957606,"c":1,"y":0.53523755687478825,"t":"Good idea.","x":0.14436722857474013},{"c":1,"t":"Well, I thought for this experiment we could look at the relationship between seed","y":0.55086928515196398,"x":0.144736837039459,"w":0.62406016031901035,"h":0.016097875080489432},{"h":0.017492400548263176,"x":0.14473683042800181,"t":"size and the way the seeds are planted. So, we could plant different sized seeds in","c":1,"y":0.5668604649828225,"w":0.63721806844075524},{"w":0.31578946431477861,"y":0.58274307795174274,"h":0.016097875080489321,"x":0.14473684669599418,"t":"different ways, and see which grow best.","c":1},{"x":0.070575573630471233,"t":"EMMA:","y":0.59907660659836071,"c":1,"w":0.043092549641927089,"h":0.01372264142352686},{"c":1,"y":0.61627906981772529,"t":"JACK:","x":0.071428571513848543,"w":0.037593984603881844,"h":0.010174418447559619},{"c":1,"t":"OK. We'd need to allow time for the seeds to come up.","y":0.59883720949790853,"w":0.42105262756347661,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.14661654323618081},{"c":1,"w":0.03571428616841632,"h":0.013081395234588844,"x":0.79323308238571655,"y":0.59883720932097506,"t":"Q22"},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"w":0.61090225219726568,"t":"That should be fine if we start now. A lot of the other possible experiments need","x":0.14473684373219431,"y":0.61482558145044797},{"w":0.13721804300944013,"h":0.014634091241545466,"c":1,"y":0.63071474558613616,"t":"quite a bit longer.","x":0.1447368429454679},{"c":1,"t":"EMMA:","w":0.044530188242594415,"h":0.012968284425164289,"y":0.64627069905770718,"x":0.070827559523668274},{"t":"So that'd make it a good one to choose. And I don't suppose it'd need much","x":0.14456940590789544,"h":0.021340863288638712,"c":1,"y":0.64237048161211041,"w":0.58301528930664059},{"x":0.14652507525634736,"t":"equipment; we're not doing chemical analysis or anything. Though that's not really","h":0.019570793402402198,"c":1,"y":0.66023568302768187,"w":0.62989354451497392},{"y":0.67667705893605556,"x":0.14648517402637129,"t":"an issue, we've got plenty of equipment in the laboratory.","c":1,"h":0.018626159648318041,"w":0.43821299235026046},{"t":"JACK:","y":0.69331395338197876,"w":0.035714286168416348,"x":0.07330827056710762,"h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1},{"x":0.14661652992140944,"c":1,"h":0.014810045074050149,"w":0.59398498535156241,"y":0.69317450107448719,"t":"Yeah. We need to have a word with the tutor if we're going to go ahead with it"},{"x":0.14651334164634838,"c":1,"y":0.70739111491522366,"h":0.019621650710538785,"w":0.63554311116536466,"t":"though. I'm sure our aim's OK. It's not very ambitious but the assignment's only ten"},{"x":0.14650059900893012,"y":0.72334942027836269,"w":0.68069315592447921,"h":0.019535451570941942,"c":1,"t":"percent of our final mark, isn't it? But we need to be sure we're the only ones doing Q23"},{"w":0.041353384653727218,"t":"EMMA:","x":0.073308269975767976,"y":0.75726744174570904,"c":1,"h":0.011627907148116789},{"h":0.011627907148116789,"w":0.035714286168416348,"x":0.073308270308648976,"t":"JACK:","y":0.77180232543756955,"c":1},{"y":0.78779069752413278,"c":1,"x":0.073308270245295043,"h":0.011627907148116901,"w":0.043233083089192714,"t":"EMMA:"},{"w":0.038384354909261079,"y":0.8319552984201527,"c":1,"t":"JACK:","x":0.072150420135438126,"h":0.016214735494148091},{"c":1,"h":0.015081742158338352,"x":0.073771359977609724,"y":0.86396212287002794,"w":0.043963273366292327,"t":"EMMA:"},{"c":1,"w":0.03759398460388183,"y":0.88081395333001133,"t":"JACK:","x":0.073308270644487653,"h":0.011627907148116789},{"x":0.14653494003810372,"y":0.75427957974041049,"t":"Yeah, it's only five percent actually, but it'd be a bit boring if everyone was doing it.","h":0.02172538256230705,"c":1,"w":0.62614766438802083},{"x":0.14837132851675175,"y":0.77013193380002309,"t":"Did you read that book on seed germination on our reading list?","w":0.48900238037109378,"h":0.020740229010351774,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.14651029221015524,"t":"The one by Graves? I looked through it for my last experiment, though it wasn't all","y":0.78535265214177052,"h":0.02043041074498575,"w":0.62620839436848963},{"h":0.022149416990458248,"w":0.61874252319335943,"c":1,"y":0.80025171442887433,"x":0.14647914286624691,"t":"that relevant there. It would be for this experiment, though. I found it quite hard to"},{"h":0.019179573231025815,"t":"follow - lots about the theory, which I hadn't expected.","w":0.41754056294759112,"c":1,"x":0.14649329748878206,"y":0.81820579864571064},{"w":0.63188100179036466,"h":0.022624247318225987,"c":1,"t":"Yes, I'd been hoping for something more practical. It does include references to the","x":0.14836797275254279,"y":0.83159965137323644},{"h":0.020501966408891015,"t":"recent findings on genetically-modified seeds, though.","y":0.85015220733333385,"x":0.14648133589967499,"c":1,"w":0.41570223490397135},{"t":"Yes, that was interesting.","c":1,"y":0.86606989196829554,"h":0.020801352594870592,"x":0.1480127974886839,"w":0.1964092508951823},{"h":0.01977975554260536,"w":0.40239713033040364,"t":"I read an article about seed germination by Lee Hall","x":0.14655285024713188,"y":0.88077196011616932,"c":1},{"x":0.78947368429580345,"t":"Q24","y":0.80087209303950058,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"w":0.037593984603881858},{"x":0.84398496204128037,"y":0.96511627907238573,"t":"99","w":0.028195489247639927,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1}]}